otherboard undoubtedly stands out as one of the top choices in the market for driving ultra-high performance. This article will provide a detailed introduction to the features and characteristics of this motherboard, exploring how it becomes the strongest match for the Intel \n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>HONG KONG</span> <span>10/24/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG MAXIMUS Z890 APEX Media review Award of e-zone Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://ezone.hk/article/20046633/ASUS-ROG-MAXIMUS-Z890-APEX-Intel-Core-Ultra-200S-%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%97%E6%9C%80%E5%BC%B7%E7%B5%95%E9%85%8D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202502051635231600473.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Guru3d\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      A significant update in the Z890 Apex is its new white design, replacing the traditional black color scheme found in earlier models. This aesthetic change makes the motherboard an attractive option for builds that emphasize a white color palette\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsIt